{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:280f16b759b617c893a8f51317ee795f77fe176f343e908549922fb721d82982",
      "text": "能做的事，就是绝不轻言放弃",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d6fcb1c280391d52390947a01c49d075ff02ba0574b16f90f95cdca8cabc54d",
      "text": "确定出演音乐节目的F-LAGS的三人。\n然而，该节目正面临停播危机，\n现场气氛糟糕透顶。\n于是三人决定通过让所有人展露笑容，\n来引导节目走向成功。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80e498f00eddab0e29051b175768d604c18ab0086fada3bff7c892660c85b4f1",
      "text": "第8话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:280f16b759b617c893a8f51317ee795f77fe176f343e908549922fb721d82982",
      "text": "能做的事，就是绝不轻言放弃",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e35381fef96d59385ae1563a2431c49915b8fbb1e6aa400a96ce6d1abd92fd01",
      "text": "某处洋房",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3d603dc329d92372d4f05b084f55ace71836e9954c4a14946d946f435d75f1f",
      "text": "有人前来商量能否追加JIF的出演者。\n据说是那个投票名额中名列前茅的事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16cab9592dc7a4271f459cc149d1427d2a97806086cef50d104a60af9ca27726",
      "text": "……把资料拿给我看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f98eaa981c630d0ccfb1a26df8f2458dffc67d0dcd988b5592d43adad92a99",
      "text": "糟了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14926d0e06b510bf515122103745ab3254d6da79a86174204f0e25d84f29642e",
      "text": "上啊，武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3135d45417ac312d919378308729eb95602e6bb90bb6fda2bd7f48c9fdecf19",
      "text": "哈啊啊啊啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99a00a8e290cc3770241d62e2eb39e5ca33067c998b41977d7f487b31af6aecd",
      "text": "这是前些天举行的活动录像。\n这支组合似乎叫做THE 虎牙道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f48438fd7e82ebc85168aa44517f8a95b273005ebcf0978e10f4de86c167c8a6",
      "text": "哎呀，居然狠狠给了雷皇一记重击。这样看来，\n那男人会想支持他们倒也不是不能理解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16869eafbdd267b9648669a6c979258a77f99def85640765c16c7a74b6731083",
      "text": "（话虽如此……说到底，\n偶像这种存在真的有未来吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfcaa66453474b10f1a5515884f33b570994ff6a7f18bf830181bc5148569fd2",
      "text": "（总觉得无论涌现出什么事务所或偶像，最终\n也不过是落在差不多的规模和销量里）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bcbbb002ce78761cd9fda1c1497f78d6f32dfd48ed08b473d441156a5d836ab",
      "text": "（比起这种已经触及天花板的行业，我原本认为应该\n投资更有前景的领域……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6de7d56ce8beef2856d6d1b2618211a20462eedeea7352edba451a319be5e5d1",
      "text": "……这家事务所里的偶像组合，\n哪支都行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:461219de3c3d79f1537296abb4d8f97955f42bf901e37f6c6d2709bdd6b13b34",
      "text": "我们不是有出资赞助的音乐节目吗。\n叫他们上那个节目。我要通过节目好好审视一番。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4b73f1f69477fabfb52cd707febbe2b1a30550e774bc8e808cb585319f46a7d",
      "text": "审视315 Production出演JIF的资格，\n以及“偶像”这门行当。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6413b3e4f200ba01a6ed2464de5fd2a5b3b9a5900fb8343162dc994f00353c3",
      "text": "（……手段真恶劣啊。那个节目最近\n收视率很差，听说现场气氛也糟糕透顶……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
